  "episode_id": "ep05",
  "problem": "Let  \\[ f(x) =\n\\begin{cases}\n-x^2 & \\text{if } x \\geq 0,\\\\\nx+8& \\text{if } x <0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\]Compute $f(f(f(f(f(1))))).$",
  "solution_to_review": "\\begin{align*}\n(f(f(f(f(1)))))\n&=f(f(f(f(-2))))\\\\\n&=f(f(f(6)))\\\\\n&=f(f(-30))\\\\\n\\intertext{Now applying the piecewise definition again,}\n&=f(-38)\\\\\n&=\\boxed{-30}.\\\\\n\\end{align*}"
}
